## 2. 文档与代码同步

继承全局规则 `global-coding.mdc` §1：本仓库的代码改动必须同步 `docs/`。

具体映射（按仓库约定补充）：

| 代码改动 | 必改文档 |
|---|---|
| `.github/workflows/cd.yml` | `docs/10-DEPLOYMENT.md` |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | `docs/09-TEST-STRATEGY.md` + `docs/10-DEPLOYMENT.md` |
| `src/main/resources/application.yml` | `docs/02-TDS.md` + `docs/05-API-SPECIFICATION.md`（如果改了端口） |
| `src/main/resources/db/init.sql` 或 Flyway | `docs/04-ER-DESIGN.md` |
| `.env.example` | `docs/10-DEPLOYMENT.md` §3（Secrets 配置） |
| `docker-compose.yml` | `docs/10-DEPLOYMENT.md` §1 + `docs/02-TDS.md` §基础设施 |
| `scripts/postgres-init/` | `docs/04-ER-DESIGN.md` §扩展说明 |
| `Dockerfile` | `docs/02-TDS.md` §构建规范 |

